# Pairs with TenantRuleConfinement. Dropping the confinement guard lets a
# tenant admin scope a rule to another tenant's tree or grant Telemetry.
MODULE: FacadePutRuleSkipsConfinement
TARGET: TenantRuleConfinement
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the store accepts a tenant rule outside its tenant's trees or data-plane operations
PERTURBS: FacadePutRule

--- FIND
          ELSE IF ~StoreAdmits(draft) THEN Refuse("putRule", auth, fl, "refused", FALSE)
--- REPLACE
          ELSE IF FALSE THEN Refuse("putRule", auth, fl, "refused", FALSE)
--- END
